WEBVTT

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.540
(GROANS)

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.820
(SIGHS)

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.380
(PANTING)

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.020
You are such an idiot.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.620
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:19.860
-(GROWLING)
-(GASPS)

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.700
(SNIFFLING)

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:24.900
(SHRIEKS)

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.500
(GROWLING)

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:31.100
What is your problem, Ralph?
I told you, don't follow me.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.060
Friend?

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.420
Cut that out.
You're scaring me.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.100
-Friend!
-Huh? Whoa!

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.860
-What the...?
-Friend?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.820
-(GRUNTING)
-(YELPS)

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.260
RALPH CLONES: Friend!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.860
(RALPH CLONES SHOUTING)

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:54.060
Sweet mother of Ralph!

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:55.260
NEWS ANCHOR: In breaking news,

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.500
the Internet
is under assault...

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.820
as a massive
denial-of-service attack...

00:00:58.900 --> 00:00:59.900
crashes servers
across the web.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:00.980
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.260
The Wreck-It Ralph virus

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:04.780
is fast-moving
and destructive.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.220
Friend? Huh? (GROWLS)

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.220
(GASPS)

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.260
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:13.580
Friend?

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.780
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.100
Huh?

00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.300
Experts are still trying to
understand who or what

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:24.260
the virus's intended
target may be.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:28.740
Friend.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.220
RALPH CLONES: Friend.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.140
(SHOUTING)

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:34.540
Friend!

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.380
RALPH CLONES: Friend!

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.420
(SHUDDERING)

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.940
I found 130 results for

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:42.460
"Where does my high school
girlfriend live now?"

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:44.900
You're welcome.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.780
-VANELLOPE: Mr. KnowsMore!
-Hmm.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.340
Oh, delightful!

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.860
You're that courteous
little cherub

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.460
who says "please"
and "thank you."

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:53.100
What can KnowsMore
help you find today?

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.180
There's a whole...

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.500
Whole Foods,
a hole in the ozone...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.580
A Whole Lotta Love by
British rockers Led Zeppelin?

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.900
No! No! There's a whole bunch
of Ralphs chasing me.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.860
RALPH CLONES: Friend...

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:05.420
This would probably be
an appropriate time

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.820
for me to shutter my site.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.020
(STRAINING)

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.300
(EXCLAIMING)

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.340
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.660
-(PANTING)
-How long you think

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.020
before they get in here?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.620
-(BANGING ON SHUTTER)
-(GASPS) Precisely one second.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.380
(GASPING)

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:22.940
-Ooh! Ow! Ow! Ow!
-(VANELLOPE GRUNTING)

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:24.020
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.340
It's me!
It's the real me!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.300
Ow! (EXCLAIMING)

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:29.900
-Ralph?
-My apologies.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.460
I followed those things here.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:32.820
I think they're looking
for you, kid.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.700
Yeah, you think?
What did you do?

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.860
I'm so sorry.
I don't how this happened.

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:41.140
Well, I think
it's fairly obvious.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.580
It happened because
an insecurity virus cloned...

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.300
all of your needy, clingy,
self-destructive behavior.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:48.100
The very behavior
which left unchecked

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.340
can destroy friendships...

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:53.100
and in this particular case,
the entire Internet! (GASPS)

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:54.820
(VANELLOPE AND
KNOWSMORE EXCLAIM)

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:56.620
KnowsMore!
You have all the answers.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:58.100
Official query...

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.220
what do I do if clones of me

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:02.620
are trying to capture
my friend? Search.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.100
(SHUDDERING)

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.340
I find two results
for your query.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.380
Either you put all the clones
in therapy.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.380
Not very realistic.

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.420
Or, the anti-virus district
is surrounded

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.380
by a gate made from
security software.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.540
If Vanellope could somehow

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:16.660
lead all of the clones
through the gate...

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.660
they would be deleted
all at once.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.060
Sort of a co-dependent
pied piper situation.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.580
Wait. We know a pied piper.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.220
-We do?
-Yesss.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:27.580
-Who?
-Yesss!

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:28.860
Yeah, but who is it?

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:32.700
Oh, you mean Yesss!

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:38.900
Thanks for your help,
KnowsMore.

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.940
It's a bit of an empty gesture
at this point,

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.180
wouldn't you say?

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:44.540
(SIGHS)
Guess I forgot to tell Ralph

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.980
that when you
break the Internet...

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.780
you don't literally
have to break the Internet.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:50.260
I can't believe he did this.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.740
Yeah, well, I mean,
dude obviously made

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:54.780
some real questionable
choices here.

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.940
But he also made a bee pun to
save his best friend's game...

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:03.100
so what can I say, kid,
life's complicated.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.140
You ready to pied the piper?

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.620
(RALPH CLONE GRUNTING)

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.180
VANELLOPE: Yoo-hoo! Up here!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.580
It's me, your bestest friend
in the whole wide world...

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.100
who you can't live without!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.860
RALPH CLONES: Friend!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.300
Wow, from up here I can see
how I do come across as...

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.940
needy, and clingy,

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:29.780
and self-destructive
like KnowsMore said.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.140
Listen, kid...

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.300
I don't blame you

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.100
for not wanting
to be my friend anymore.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.260
I never said I didn't want to
be your friend.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:41.140
I said you were acting like
a bad friend. Which you were.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.660
I know I was, but I...

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:43.900
YESSS: Hey, my babies!

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.140
That's the anti-virus district
straight ahead. Whoo!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.980
All right, to be continued,
okay?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.140
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.580
Whoo-hoo! We're gonna make it!

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.460
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.740
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.660
RALPH: You guys okay?

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.100
-I'm fine!
-(YESSS SIGHS)

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.020
Yeah, all good.
Look, we can still do this.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.580
Come on, big man.
Help me turn this thing over.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.700
(YESSS GRUNTING)

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.060
Uh... (GASPS)

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:28.060
Uh, guys?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.860
-(RALPH GRUNTS)
-(GASPS)

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:31.980
(GASPS)

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.140
(RALPH CLONES GRUNTING)

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:41.780
RALPHZILLA: Friend?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.980
That is unsettling.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.820
(RALPHZILLA GRUNTING)

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:49.540
-Friend.
-(GASPS)

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.660
Get Vanellope out of here now.

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:52.820
What about you, Ralph?

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.100
Just go. I got a date
with the man in the mirror.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.460
Hey, you!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.620
(GRUNTING)

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:02.620
You keep away from her!

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:04.700
I'm gonna wreck it!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:07.420
-(ELECTRICITY CRACKLING)
-(RALPHZILLA GROANING)

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.500
-She's not your friend!
-(RALPHZILLA GROANING)

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.060
She's my friend!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.380
Here it is, this way.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.620
Come on, kid. We gotta move.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.180
(RALPH GRUNTING)

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.460
(RALPHZILLA GROWLING)

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.540
Eeeee-oh-boy!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:35.020
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.780
(GASPING)

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.420
(GRUNTING)

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.980
(RALPHZILLA GROANING)

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:48.500
(BOTH EXCLAIMING)

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.900
(GASPS) No!

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.300
Whoa! (YELPS)

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:55.540
-Vanellope!
-(SCREAMING)

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.540
(VANELLOPE GRUNTS, EXCLAIMS)

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.460
VANELLOPE: Hey! Let go of me!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.140
(RALPH GRUNTING)

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.820
-Kid!
-Ralph!

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.340
(GRUNTING)

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.540
Hey!

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:15.380
Hey, get back here!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.820
RALPHZILLA: Huh?

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.740
You put her down!

00:07:19.820 --> 00:07:21.300
Whoa!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:24.580
(EXCLAIMS, GRUNTING)

